{"sections":[{"slug":"范畴论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"范畴论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">学科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"范畴论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"学科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是集合概念的某种推广</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">范畴中有</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">对象</span></strong>, <span lang=\"zh\">正如集合中有元素</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">但不同在于集合中的元素只有相等或不相等两种关系</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而范畴中的对象可以有多种且不对称的关系</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">态射</span></strong>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">最经典的范畴是集合的范畴</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">其中对象为集合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $X\\to Y$ <span lang=\"zh\">为集合之间的映射</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般说的范畴的概念又称为</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">它处在一个无穷高的阶梯的第</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">层</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">而集合的概念在第</span> $0$ <span lang=\"zh\">层</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">集合又可称为</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">我们发现全体</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴构成一个</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">事实上全体</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴也构成一个</span> $(n+1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个无穷高的阶梯中每一层的对象的全体构成上一层的一个最基本的对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">范畴的对象之间也可以谈论相等</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但区别在于两个对象之间可能有多种不同方式相等</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">甚至一个对象和自身也可能有多种不同方式相等</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">对称性</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">另见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}